       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115IHI0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Lars Gaustad.                                           00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_History.          00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220000
      *                                                                 00230000
      *    Initialize                          R115IHI0-History         00240000
      *    Set   R115IHI0-Version        To    True                     00250000
      *    Set   R115IHI0-In-Select      To    True                     00260000
      *                                                                 00270000
      * One of these:                                                   00280000
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00290000
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00300000
      *                                                                 00310000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IHI0-In-Contract-Type00320000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IHI0-In-Contract-No  00330000
      *                                                                 00340000
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IHI0-In-CA-Currency  00350000
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IHI0-In-PA-Seq-No    00360000
      *                                                                 00370000
      *    Move  &transaction seq.no     To    R115IHI0-In-TR-Seq-No    00380000
      *                                                                 00390000
      *    Call  'F115IHI0'              Using R115IHI0-History         00400000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00410000
      *    End-Call                                                     00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00440000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00450000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00460000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00470000
      *                                                                 00480000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00490000
      *        ...not found...                                          00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00520000
      *        ...found...                                              00530000
      *                                                                 00540000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00550000
      *                                                                 00560000
      *################################################################*00570000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00580000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00590000
      *130999!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00600000
      *################################################################*00610000
       Environment Division.                                            00620000
       Configuration Section.                                           00630000
       Special-Names.                                                   00640000
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00650000
      *                                                                 00660000
      *################################################################*00670000
       Data Division.                                                   00680000
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00690000
      *                                                                 00700000
       01  Filler.                                                      00710000
      *                                                                 00720000
           05  W-Table-Name              Pic  X(18) Value               00730000
                                                   'TF_History        '.00740000
      *                                                                 00750000
           05  W-IO-Length               Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00760000
           05  W-Tally                   Pic S9(05)              Comp.  00770000
